⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡠⡮⠋⠀⠙⢿⣷⠔⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
⠀⠀⠀⠀⣀⣠⡾⠊⠀⠀⢀⢔⠕⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
⠀⠀⠀⢷⣸⣊⠀⠀⠀⢰⠕⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
⠀⡀⣀⠜⠓⣝⠵⣂⣔⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
⠨⠓⣅⠔⡄⠉⠙⠂⠂⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
⠀⠑⠠⠂⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
"""

AGENT_DIRS = [
    Path("/System/Library/LaunchAgents"),
    Path("/Library/LaunchAgents"),
    Path("/Library/Apple/System/Library/LaunchAgents"),
    Path("/System/Cryptexes/App/System/Library/LaunchAgents"),
]

DAEMON_DIRS = [
    Path("/System/Library/LaunchDaemons"),
    Path("/Library/LaunchDaemons"),
    Path("/Library/Apple/System/Library/LaunchDaemons"),
    Path("/System/Cryptexes/App/System/Library/LaunchDaemons"),
]

def run(cmd):
    return subprocess.run(
        cmd,
        stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,
        stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,
        check=False
    )

def get_labels():
    labels = []

    for raw in PRESET.read_text(errors="ignore").splitlines():
        line = raw.strip()

        if not line or line.startswith("#"):
            continue

        line = line.split("#", 1)[0].strip()

        if line:
            labels.append(line)

    return list(dict.fromkeys(labels))

def service_type(label):
    for directory in DAEMON_DIRS:
        if (directory / f"{label}.plist").exists():
            return "system"

    for directory in AGENT_DIRS:
        if (directory / f"{label}.plist").exists():
            return "user"

    return "user"

def disable(label):
    if service_type(label) == "system":
        run(["sudo", "launchctl", "disable", f"system/{label}"])
    else:
        run(["launchctl", "disable", f"gui/{UID}/{label}"])

def enable(label):
    if service_type(label) == "system":
        run(["sudo", "launchctl", "enable", f"system/{label}"])
    else:
        run(["launchctl", "enable", f"gui/{UID}/{label}"])

def apply():
    for label in get_labels():
        disable(label)

    run(["sudo", "mdutil", "-a", "-i", "off"])
    print(BANNER)

def restore():
    for label in get_labels():
        enable(label)

    run(["sudo", "mdutil", "-a", "-i", "on"])

    print(BANNER)
    print("ZXT services restored.")

def status():
    print(BANNER)
    print(f"Preset services: {len(get_labels())}")

def main():
    if len(sys.argv) == 1:
        apply()
        return

    command = sys.argv[1].lower()

    if command in ("apply", "--apply"):
        apply()
    elif command in ("restore", "--restore"):
        restore()
    elif command in ("status", "--status"):
        status()
    else:
        print("Usage: zxt [apply|status|restore]")

if __name__ == "__main__":
    main()
